# The gateway's image (Dockerfile.prod) is built from the Rust gateway and the panel alone: only they go into the
# build context. Everything else stays out — recorded sessions, voices, keys and local env copies, logs, people's
# messages, model caches, and the builds (target/ is gigabytes).
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!gateway
!content/radio.json
!content/README.md
# What the program carries inside besides its own folder (include_str!, rust-embed): the built-in packages, the
# station's scripts, the plugin workshop's guides. scripts/check-docker-context.mjs (CI) fails when one is missing.
!packages
!station-client/voice.sh
!station-client/S95duowave
!station-client/call-client.sh
!station-client/gateway.sh
!docs/plugins/AUTHORING.md
!docs/plugins/panel-sdk.d.ts
!docs/plugins/skill
!docs/design/glass/THEMES.md
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!panel
!deploy/station-payload
!deploy/prebuilt

# Inside what is let in: nothing built, nothing private.
panel/node_modules
panel/dist
panel/.impeccable
**/.DS_Store
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.wav
**/*.ogg
**/*.opus
**/*.pcm
**/*.mp3
